  {
   "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/conditions/doomed.webp",
   "name": "Doomed",
   "system": {
    "description": {
     "gm": "",
     "value": "<p>A powerful force has gripped your soul, calling you closer to death. Doomed always includes a value. The @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} value at which you die is reduced by your doomed value. If your maximum dying value is reduced to 0, you instantly die. When you die, you're no longer doomed.</p>\n<p>Your doomed value decreases by 1 each time you get a full night's rest.</p>"
    },
